IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. ECHO-REQUESTER.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 REQUEST-TEXT PIC X(40) VALUE "Hello from SCREEN COBOL".
01 REPLY-TEXT PIC X(40).
SCREEN SECTION.
01 MAIN-SCREEN SIZE 24, 80.
05 FILLER AT 1, 2 VALUE "Pulse Pathway - resilient echo".
05 FILLER AT 3, 2 VALUE "Request:".
05 REQUEST-FIELD AT 3, 12 PIC X(40) USING REQUEST-TEXT.
05 FILLER AT 5, 2 VALUE "Reply:".
05 REPLY-FIELD AT 5, 12 PIC X(40) FROM REPLY-TEXT.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
DISPLAY BASE MAIN-SCREEN.
ACCEPT MAIN-SCREEN.
SEND REQUEST-TEXT TO "echo" REPLY CODE 0 YIELDS REPLY-TEXT.
DISPLAY MAIN-SCREEN.
STOP RUN.
